	(text "Battery ADC: Vbat = ADC voltage x 3 (calibrate in firmware).\nQ4/Q5 isolate the divider while 3V3 is off, avoiding unpowered-GPIO backfeed.\nMain switch controls EN; USB charging remains connected while system is off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 227.33 163.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "862cbf9b-714a-4712-977d-7ce383fec0c2")
	)
	(text "GPIO38 HIGH permits charging. LOW / high-Z pauses it with POWER ON.\nPOWER OFF allows charging. This is not USB source-current detection."
